      "text": "Draft heads of terms for the proposed acquisition of Northwind Analytics by Bidder A, prepared from Bidder A's indication of interest of $112.0M and the company's recorded positions, for the parties' counsel to complete. It is not a binding document and has not been reviewed by counsel."
